                    {
                        "sense_id": "f870880a-0bb0-3c8b-aefc-046221fb3fa9",
                        "entry_id": "01a25a73-9c16-3e92-a4a6-ef2e58fef1cf",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The condition of being ugly."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b2738c4d-b956-4397-8fd5-1c0c561c6455",
                                "sense_id": "f870880a-0bb0-3c8b-aefc-046221fb3fa9",
                                "text": "His best friend would not have called him good-looking, but he was the fortunate possessor of that cheerful type of ugliness which inspires immediate confidence in its owner."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a584beef-bf3f-4a43-afb4-2aec0d103c72",
                                "sense_id": "f870880a-0bb0-3c8b-aefc-046221fb3fa9",
                                "text": "Everything that's realistic has some sort of ugliness in it. Even a flower is ugly when it wilts, a bird when it seeks its prey, the ocean when it becomes violent. Sharon Tate"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "48fe9cab-7244-3efb-b810-4e034c0615e0",
                        "entry_id": "01a25a73-9c16-3e92-a4a6-ef2e58fef1cf",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An unsightly or frightful object."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "626e06f0-fe4e-3ffa-8a82-d7f9a25267e9",
                        "entry_id": "01a25a73-9c16-3e92-a4a6-ef2e58fef1cf",
                        "glosses": [
